<p>
    This incident is shown because of a PHP notice message. Typically this means your system works as expected, but
    there are some minor issues such as using a deprecated language feature.
</p>

<p>
    Notice information:
    <table class="table table-bordered">
        <tr>
            <td>Type</td><td>{{ incident.getFirstEvent().getType() }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>File</td><td>{{ incident.getFirstEvent().getFile() }}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Line</td><td>{{ incident.getFirstEvent().getLine() }}</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    Notice log:
    <table class="table table-bordered">
        {% for error in incident.getEvents() %}
            <tr>
                <td>{{ error.getDateCreated()|date }}</td>
                <td>{{ error.getMessage() }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </table>
</p>

<p>
    You can try to solve the notice using the above information, most of the times issue is related to your environment
    (outdated PHP version, misconfigured environment etc). If you think that this is caused by DeskPRO source,
    you can contact us and we'll produce a solution ASAP.
</p>
